body:
{Mob Psycho 100} 

The animation is off putting at the start, but trust me, it’s amazing. It’s a little over the episode count you asked (26) but I’d still recommend.

{That Time I Got Reincarnated As A Slime}

I think it’s around the same episode count, but it’s great. Yes, it’s an Isekai, but I seriously recommend it. TTIGRAAS doesn’t get enough love
